		{
			description: [
				"Passive skill tree mod is a simple skill mod to progress in your adventure "
				""
				"To get started, gather some experience to acquire your first skill point."
				""
				"Then press O (default key, if it doesn't work - check your key bindings)."
				""
				"Then select your class but choose carefully, you cannot change it."
				""
				"You can path to other classes later if you think it is worth it."
				""
				"Maximum skill points are &465&r, so plan your tree carefully."
				""
				"NEW MECHANICS"
				""
				"GEMS"
				""
				"You can find gems in any ore."
				""
				"Can be inserted into equipment on a smithing table."
				""
				"To remove gems from equipment, you need to insert vacucite gem into it. It will consume all the gems."
				""
				"Vacucite have a smaller drop chance."
